{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing Sudoku and Futoshiki is a calming casual game that merges the logic of Sudoku and Futoshiki into a serene sakura garden theme. Players solve puzzles in a tranquil setting filled with soft pastels, fluttering petals, and soothing music, with adjustable difficulty and hint systems to ensure a stress-free, frustration-free experience. The game balances mindful challenges with peaceful visuals and soundscapes, offering a gentle escape for puzzle enthusiasts seeking relaxation and mental clarity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Touch / Left mouse click: cycle up the number on the tile</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right mouse click: cycle down the number on the tile</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse-wheel: cycle up or down the number on the tile</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double click: show a pop up to store clues</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3877060?t=1757969085","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3877060?t=1757969085","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877060/b810efe96bb7b6039f254d65988956276cc41bae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757969085","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877060/b810efe96bb7b6039f254d65988956276cc41bae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757969085","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3954770,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragr